  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-review-and-next-dddccdec-0644-4607-b8c2-5b366dcda48b",
        "text": "Wow! Look at Fayea's website now! We've come so far, from just a blank page to a truly informative and stylish site.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2f51a759a7be767e73531c88d88221b2-agathaweb-review-and-next-panel-1-b108d638-4f7d-4076-851d-9b4f1729ae83.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-review-and-next-69d73783-fe89-4443-9fc9-fe17c12d97e8",
        "text": "Remember how we started with HTML tags like `<html>`, `<head>`, and `<body>` to build the basic structure?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b1e8bdafb2e317bb74815c13b8503fcb-agathaweb-review-and-next-panel-2-fe19b6d5-2caf-42af-8316-ea88f15c73f2.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-review-and-next-3c51201f-1d5c-4648-b685-88e006dd5000",
        "text": "Then we added titles with `<h1>`, sections with `<h2>`, and paragraphs with `<p>` to fill it with Fayea's awesome content!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/72e80a0482a64c6eb1ed7af716fc495c-agathaweb-review-and-next-panel-3-3619f066-6d29-4862-9614-4b6024881d38.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-review-and-next-e182aab9-394e-4650-a59b-d8840453c3a3",
        "text": "We also learned to add images using the `<img>` tag and created easy navigation links with `<a>` tags for visitors to explore.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/55cf9de428a0dd8c7cca30867f070277-agathaweb-review-and-next-panel-4-bb696025-da84-446d-8aba-1ec0c2f140eb.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-review-and-next-4a18ae61-c3d7-4941-8f0d-9426979903c4",
        "text": "And don't forget CSS! We used it to add a background color, change text colors, and adjust font sizes to make Fayea's site look vibrant and inviting.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3fecfaf22b14896c99b8c94ea4357ee3-agathaweb-review-and-next-panel-5-9460aac7-c244-4da7-8fb4-c56c8c8c693d.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-review-and-next-64d34c76-7fe4-420d-8ed8-797fdfaae19e",
        "text": "This is a fantastic foundation! With these skills, we can expand Fayea's website with more pages, interactive elements, and even make it look great on any device!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4caf394236e86e11a2d5d0805d070c7c-agathaweb-review-and-next-panel-6-970b320e-0b88-4e27-8242-2666644a56ae.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Review the completed basic website for Fayea, highlighting all the new skills learned (HTML structure, content, images, basic CSS, links). Discuss how this foundational website can be expanded for more complex features and interactivity."
  },
